set_option autoImplicit false

/-!
# Kernel-only certificate: exact P-94 twist and in-out perception

This target closes the two remaining represented P-94.3.2 families without treating the old
equivalence-component test as a twist path.  A twist candidate must occur strictly inside one
orientation-invariant single-bond-rotation path between spatially distinct coordinate-derived boat
endpoints and must itself be neither a boat nor a chair.  In-out direction is derived from exact
rational coordinates relative to an independently validated, bridgehead-indexed interior witness;
actual bridgehead identity is distinct from complete framework membership, and same-site/electron
facts that the present raw-molecule carrier cannot derive are exposed as explicit premises.
-/

